        {
            "title": "Breaking News",
            "date": "2018-07-28 14:14:05",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2462791699378223163",
            "notes": "Our plans for game release in July have been slightly overset. \r\nBetween the release of the second and the third DLC for [b]XXX Puzzle[/b] we were to release [b]Mojo[/b]. Unfortunately, [b]Mojo[/b] release is several weeks behind schedule. This is why the release of the remaining DLCs is postponed until August.\r\n\r\nOur plans are as follows: \r\n- Release of Expansion Pack 3 – August 10.\r\n- Release of Expansion Pack 4 – August 17 or 24."
        },
